Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,《变形金刚6：超能勇士崛起》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:01:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们文明之初 流传着一个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a legend that precedes the dawn of our civilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.09,0:01:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一个非常巨大 非常强大...\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vile god, so large and so powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,以吞噬行星为能量的邪恶之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it consumed entire planets as fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没人相信这传说是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few believed such a thing could be true,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,直到有一天我们亲眼看到了宇宙大帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the day we saw Unicron with our own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不是冲着我们的星球而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't just come for our planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.57,0:01:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要的是我们最前沿的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted our greatest technology,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,曲速钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Transwarp Key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他派了他最得力的手下去寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he sent his most powerful henchman to collect it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,天灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scourge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越多的敌人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More enemies are landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这里马上就会有危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't be safe for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙还在我们这里么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have the key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须拿着钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把它藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it hidden,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不要落入宇宙大帝之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that it never falls into the hands of Unicron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,圣猿 我们还可以战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Apelinq, we can fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 保护曲速钥匙才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Protecting our Transwarp Key is all that matters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,走 用它离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Use it to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.22,0:03:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我来拖住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,给你们赢得些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy you some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那我和你在一起战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm staying with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 如果宇宙大帝拿到了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if Unicron were to get the key,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它就能打开穿越时空的传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could open a portal through time and space{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,整个宇宙的毁灭将没有尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no end to the worlds he could destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是时候你来领导巨无霸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now your time to lead the Maximals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimus Primal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是这个星球上最厉害的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're this planet's great warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的世界真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have such a beautiful world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,生机勃勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}filled with an abundance of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,香甜可口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.85,0:04:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主人饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master grows hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把曲速钥匙给我 他会放一条生路给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the Transwarp Key, and he will spare your home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们宁愿毁灭 也不让他去祸害其他星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd rather die than let him reach other planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就成全你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.92,0:04:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,服侍伟大的宇宙大帝的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benefits of serving the almighty Unicron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们永远学不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,太迟了 天灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late, Scourge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你的主人将永远被困在这个星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your master will be trapped in this galaxy forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他的牺牲将是我们的誓约\N{\fnArial\fs30}His sacrifice will be our oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,保护钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}To preserve the key,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不计代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter the cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你让他们带着曲速钥匙跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let them slip away with the Transwarp Key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,搜遍整个宇宙 找出巨无霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scour the universe and find where the Maximals have gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿到钥匙后 用钥匙带我去你那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you acquire the key, use it to bring me to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙在手 唯吾独尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I have the key, I alone will reign supreme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在这里二对五 宝贝儿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's two against five here, baby ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 加油 二对五 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Come on, two against five ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 一路上遇到的对手都是垃圾 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The opponents we've met along the way have been garbage ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.35,0:06:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 现金支配着我周围的一切 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Cash dictates everything around me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ C.R.E.A.M. 得到什么... 是的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ C.R.E.A.M. gets what... Yes, it does ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 看看这个老苍蝇 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Look at this old fly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 没错 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ rest assured ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 现金支配着我周围的一切 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Cash dictates everything around me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ C.R.E.A.M. 揣着钱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ C.R.E.A.M. Taking the money ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 美元钞票 伙计们 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Dollar bills, guys ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我在犯罪的边缘长大 活跃在《纽约时报》的版面 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I grew up on the edge of crime, in the pages of the New York Times ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 妈妈对老爸大发雷霆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Mom's mad at Dad ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 于是我们搬到了少林寺 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So we moved to Shaolin Temple ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 一位年轻的小伙子 摇晃着金饰品 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A young man shaking his gold jewelry ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 傻瓜 只有这样 我才能离开.. ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Fool, it's the only way I can leave.. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 宝贝 试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, baby, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,让我换到钱 让我换到钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me the money. Show me the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.52,0:07:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,来了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 刺猬 早餐准备好了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Sonic. Breakfast ready yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是你的管家 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't your butler, Kris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计 别说真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. No names over the airwaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,小狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Tails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my bad,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克林 威尔逊大道974号 2-C公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristopher Diaz from 974 Wilson Avenue,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗·迪亚兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apartment 2-C, Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别说真名 有监听\N{\fnArial\fs30}No real names. They're listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没有政府秘密机构监听我们 小狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no secret government agencies worried about us, Tails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,趁早餐热着 你赶紧过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get your behind out here while it's hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,至少他们是这么做的 我给你熨好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least they got that going for 'em. Here, I ironed this for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我已经熨过了 - 什么…就像你煎鸡蛋一样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already ironed it. What... Like you cooked those eggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思嘛?  这是…调过味的煎蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you mean? They're just... seasoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拉到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来吃吧 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come eat, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我过不了库巴大魔王这关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get past Bowser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你也早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good morning to you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个喝了 然后吃药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink this and take your medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,喝光 好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定可以带他去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you can take him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 去医院嘛 我有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, hospital's on the way. I got time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那位女主管在的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, if that lady, that administrator, is there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:07:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她要是给你医疗账单\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she mentions a bill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:07:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉她我们正在想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell her we're handling it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的 到了明天 我就能帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will. And after today, I'll be able to help out more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你面试顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck on the interview.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.25,0:08:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘记他们讲笑话时要笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget to laugh at all their jokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,白人都那尿性 妈妈 注意言辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}White people love that shit. Ma, language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 记住 我今晚有课 所以我会晚点回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!  Remember, I have class tonight, so I'll be home late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-爱你们 -爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Los quiero. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 伙计 我们得进城一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, man. We gotta get into the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hold up. Hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手又疼了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hand's hurting again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,都肿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's swollen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,镰状细胞肯定又阻塞了血液流动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sickle cells must be blocking the blood flow again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这情况有多久了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has this been going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo, look, I told you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你得告诉我你不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta tell me these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个人战斗 还是我们一起战斗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fighting this alone, or we fighting it together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:08:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,主队?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.07,0:09:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,主队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,十元两张 十元……不要碰任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two for ten. Two for... Stop touching everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼 不 克里斯 我怎么跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell, no. Kris, what'd I tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让你的弟弟从婴儿床里走出来 怎么看起来挺二的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}about letting your mans come out the crib looking like a whole square?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做的就这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only so much I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,随便吧 兄弟 看 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever, bro. Look. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,噢! 我的狗!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! My dawg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候才能让我充分发挥你的才华 给你换点真金白银?\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you gonna let me put your skills to work and get you some real money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 一个连有线电视都买不起的人说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Says the dude who can't even afford cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,“说这话……”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Says the guy who..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不购买有线电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose not to purchase cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是用我自己的方式抗议有线电视现代资本主义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my own personal way to protest the vampiric nature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼本性!\N{\fnArial\fs30}of modern-day capitalism!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你穿着满是灰尘的西装面试顺利!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, good luck with that interview in that dusty suit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊 我来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! I'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.20,0:10:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 朋友们 这个很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. That's a good one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,甲龙是一种有甲的恐龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the Ankylosaurus was an armored dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢...感谢你们的耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, thank you... ...for being patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,实习生?  实习生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intern? Intern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我呼了你三次 你为什么不回电给我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I paged you three times. Why didn't you call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为如果我停下来给你回电的话，那就会迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I figured if I stopped to call, that would make me later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,警察在我们这\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们叫停了我们的艺术品拍卖会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They busted an art auction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,卖家称所有艺术品均是货真价实\N{\fnArial\fs30}The owner claims that everything is authentic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但警察似乎不那么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they want a second opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,达芬奇的素描是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The da Vinci sketch is legit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这幅画是赝品\N{\fnArial\fs30}The painting's a copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真品在伦敦国家美术馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real one's at the National Gallery in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:10:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马花瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman vase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这件有点价值 但这些佣金不能让你提早退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valuable, but you are not gonna retire off of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这个希腊咒语石板 这个真的会很贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Greek curse tablet, it would be expensive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's a fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看到那文字了吗?  那是罗马字体\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the spelling? Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在那个年代根本不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't even show up in that era.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.27,0:11:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,警官们 我知道了 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officers, I figured it out. So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,达芬奇的画是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The da Vinci, that is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你来自哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where did you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是何物?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-那很美 是吧? -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty neat, right? Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,它来自哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在苏丹刚被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just discovered it in Sudan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.61,0:12:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,说是荷鲁斯时期 公元前五千年 努比亚人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boys say it's Horus, fifth millennia BC, Nubian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这个符号可绝对不是象形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}This symbol is definitely not hieroglyphic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真像看起来那么奇特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it's as exotic as it looks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我要上谷歌AI了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get a feature in Minerva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 吉利安?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Jillian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 朋友们 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, team, let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,规则是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what are the rules?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟如手足 女人如衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bros before hos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,“别成麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't be a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别找麻烦 ”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go looking for a problem."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.69,0:12:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不然 我们就…会有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else we're gonna... Have a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.23,0:12:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我一会儿就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll be back in a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚兹先生吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Diaz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我们的账单付晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know we're a little behind on the bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,三个月了 在你的账户结清之前 你不能再带你弟弟来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three months behind. Until your account is current, you can't bring your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.01,0:13:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 我会付清账单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you that. I'm gonna fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只是还需要一点时间 可以先去急诊室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a little more time. Take him to the ER.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,除非病情危重 否则他不能再去急诊室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they won't see him in the ER unless he's critical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚兹 他只有11岁 !\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Diaz. He's 11!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,11岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's 11 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 克里斯 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kris, we gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-发生什么事了? -我一会儿告诉你 伙计 好吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I'll tell you later, man. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们离开这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo. Sit here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动!\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗? 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you? Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我和安全主管毕夏普先生约了面试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm here for an interview with the head of security, Mr. Bishop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我是诺亚·迪亚兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Noah Diaz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,面试取消了 不 不 肯定是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been canceled. No. No, that has to be a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是毕夏普先生吩咐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came right from Mr. Bishop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要您的签字…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need your authorization...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,毕夏普先生! 嘿!嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bishop! Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:14:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 诺亚·迪亚兹先生 我觉得你的人可能弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Noah Diaz. Sir, I think your boy back there is confused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他说我们的面试取消了 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said our interview was canceled. Because it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 为什么? 是您在电话里说我很适合这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, why? On the phone you said I was perfect for the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,您说这只是个形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said this was just a formality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在你的老领导给我通电话前确实是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was until your old commanding officer called me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你很勇敢 很专业 但不可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said you were brave, an expert comtech, but unreliable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,无法信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是心不在焉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head was always somewhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.65,0:14:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我可以解释这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I can explain all of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我在家里有一些情况 我弟弟 他病了……\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had some responsibilities at home. My brother, he's sick...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你是为美国军队服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a responsibility to the United States Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.43,0:14:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,毕夏普先生! 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bishop! Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我工作很努力 真的? 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hard worker, okay? I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只是需要休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just really need a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不能让你这样的人毁了我在这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I can't have someone like you mess up what I've built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这样的人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone like me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,您根本不了解我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得出你不懂团队协作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't know how to be part of a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,超人在他得到星球日报的工作之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman went on a bunch of interviews{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,也参加了很多面试\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he got his job on the Daily Planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-但他从未放弃 -可我不是超人 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he never gave up. I'm not Superman, Kris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,生活可不是漫画书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life ain't a comic book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说一下 你会有下一次面试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying. You'll get the next one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没有下一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, there is no next one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会来救我们 我们就有我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's coming to save us. We're alone in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, man, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 给你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, here, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,上楼去吧 我马上就来 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just head upstairs. I'll be right there, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前和我说发挥技能是指什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what was you talking about earlier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你想要一个吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo, you want one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不需要糖果\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't want any candy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你得放轻松 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta relax, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你的负压影响了我的气场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your energy is really affecting my chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 我第一次也很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I get it. I was nervous my first time too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但你可以做一些呼吸练习 或者别的什么 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you might want to do some breathing exercises, or something. Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man, my man, my man, my man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.19,0:16:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,只是我以前没做过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just I ain't done this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但是有钱的主就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that. But them rich cats in there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们每年向慈善机构捐赠大量钞票\N{\fnArial\fs30}they give a ton of paper to charities every year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了让他们自我感觉好一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make themselves feel better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你长远来看 我们是在帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look at it from a holistic perspective, we doing them a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  你! 不客气!你能停下来吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo! You're welcome! Will you stop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在干什么? -这根本不会影响到他们的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - This ain't about to affect they pockets at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这将会非常简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's about to be easy as hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么不亲自去做呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why you ain't the one going in there and doing it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小宝贝 因为我才是幕后策划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, papito, I'm the mastermind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 把这个塞进耳朵里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come on, put this in your ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你认真的吗? 这干净吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man, you serious? Yo, is that even clean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是第四节比赛 场上还剩最后十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the fourth quarter, we got about ten seconds left on the clock,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你手握最后一击的那个球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you got the rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-把这个扔掉 -嘿 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get rid of this. - Hey, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不要猛摔门……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't slam the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我去参会募捐晚宴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I am off to my fundraiser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-你觉得怎么样? -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think? - It's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我能…我能跟你说点事吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, can I... Can I run something by you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了一些研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I've been doing some research,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为雕像是荷鲁斯时期的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't think that the statuette is Horus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 它肯定不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, I'm sure it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人认为它应该是大约在公元前5000年 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boys dated it around 5000 BC, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但是努比亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Nubians,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在公元600年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}they never even had contact with the Egyptians{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,从未与埃及人接触过\N{\fnArial\fs30}until 600 years after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这些符号显然不是象形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The symbol's not hieroglyphic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为符号不属于那个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even think it's from that part of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:18:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是阿兹特克人或印加人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it might be Aztec or Inca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是什么埃及神 应该是别的什么文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not some Egyptian god. It's something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有点意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.62,0:18:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我熨一下 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those pressed, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Let that breath fill you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,吸气…吐气\N{\fnArial\fs30}In... out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stop talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好的 你不喜欢聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, I get it, you don't like to chitchat back and forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但我有东西要给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got something for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:18:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,盗版混音带?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a robbing mixtape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,放松音带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a liberating mixtape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feeling that, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你所在的这部分楼栋应该没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there shouldn't be nobody in this part of the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该可以大摇大摆地进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be able to just waltz right on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,离大谱 这里全是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike one, mastermind. This place is packed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.87,0:19:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 那就将错就错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, well, to error is divine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把它当成你的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just act like you own the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么了 兄弟? 很高兴再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wassup, brother? Good to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,别显得可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to look suspicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.38,0:19:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,给你 给你 对不起 对不起 是你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. Here you go. Sorry. Sorry. That's you, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-眼镜不错 -我不知道…… -不知道你还戴眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice glasses. - I didn't know... - I didn't know you had glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在干什么啊 -交朋友?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, making friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.03,0:20:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-一切都好吗? -进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything good? We're in the mix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 让我看看你到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Let's see what you really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 微风吹拂车身非常惬意 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We, like the breeze Flow straight out of our lids ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 布鲁克林孩子摇滚致敬 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Them, they got moved By these hard-rock Brooklyn Kids ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 跟着节奏一起躁动不停 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Us, floor rush when the DJ,s booming classics ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 嘻哈音乐榜上赫赫有名 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You dig the crew on The fattest hip-hop record ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友说它就存放在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, my man said it's tucked in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,放了好几个星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been there a couple weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是一辆灰色的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a grayish car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,带着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with like a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色的条纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue stripe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.09,0:20:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 就像瑞克哥哥教你的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now just like brother Reek showed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,从窗户那里伸进去……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down the window...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,…轻轻扭动……\N{\fnArial\fs30}...a little wiggle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,…感受一下那个阻尼……\N{\fnArial\fs30}...feel that snag and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:20:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,…对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们就赚大钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we making money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 跟我说话啊啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Talk to me, homey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我到车里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点也不会疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't hurt a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,停 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我要失业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna lose my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.19,0:22:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要进监狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go to jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.94,0:22:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这绝不是努比亚文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's definitely not Nubian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cannot be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.21,0:23:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫所有汽车人! 呼叫所有汽车人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling all Autobots! Calling all Autobots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,走你 混...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yippee-ki-yay, mother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.29,0:23:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 我是阿尔茜 我看到一个景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime, this is Arcee. I have a visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.99,0:23:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到的是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,回家的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫所有汽车人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling all Autobots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.48,0:23:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我在做什么? 这里已经安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing? Well, the coast is clear out here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你把车开出来的时候 这里没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}so whenever you want to slide that thing on out, you good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.95,0:23:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到 我不做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.48,0:23:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会开手动挡?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you can't drive stick or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.59,0:23:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不 只是…我不是小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just... I ain't no thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.29,0:23:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在有存在危机吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you having an existential crisis now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.46,0:23:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你扭扭糖的之后就不该发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deadline for that was when I offered you Twizzlers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.46,0:23:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你能听到我吗 幻影? 出发了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me, Mirage? Roll out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.63,0:23:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谁特么在那里说话?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.33,0:23:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,收音机 伙计 这车有毛病 我要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the radio, bro. This car is buggin'. I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.74,0:24:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-我靠 -嘿 你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Hey, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.48,0:24:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,从车里出来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我试着出来! 车是自己发动的 我保证!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying! The car started by itself, I promise!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.15,0:24:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看 不管用! 马上出去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's not working! Get out now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.63,0:24:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 等等! 你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Wait! What you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.63,0:24:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 怎么了……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, what's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.93,0:24:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克! 瑞克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reek! Reek! Reek!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是秀级的表演!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's top-tier manifestation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.51,0:24:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 这车自己开了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, the car's driving by itself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.71,0:24:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, you good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.94,0:24:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道发生了什么!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.25,0:24:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它停不下来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.61,0:24:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,停! 停! 你为什么不听指挥?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, stop! Stop! Why aren't you listening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.92,0:24:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好开慢点 不是我在开 是车自己在开!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna slow down. It's not me, it's the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.45,0:24:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-它发疯了! -不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possessed! No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.19,0:24:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是肾上腺素过高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just on an adrenaline high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.99,0:24:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们做一些呼吸练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do some of them breathing exercises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.29,0:24:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要呼吸练习!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, I don't need no breathing exercises!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:24:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这车在自动驾驶!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car's driving by itself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.33,0:25:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, snap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.03,0:25:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们该怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Reek, what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.97,0:25:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 我听不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, I cannot hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.97,0:25:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克! 诺亚 我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reek! Noah, I can't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.81,0:25:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他没有! 不 他没有离开我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he did not! No, he did not just leave me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.58,0:25:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-靠边! -救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.01,0:25:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哦! 你还好吗……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Are you ok...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.26,0:26:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,开车 开车 开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive. Drive, drive, drive, drive, drive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.76,0:26:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.27,0:26:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.64,0:26:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.34,0:26:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,桥 桥 桥……\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bridge. The bridge, the bridge...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.84,0:26:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去威廉斯堡!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the Williamsburg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.85,0:26:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.55,0:26:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有一起10-37案件 银色保时捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a 10-37 in progress. Silver Porsche.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.92,0:26:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧 伙计?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serious, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.94,0:26:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 做点什么!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, do something, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.75,0:27:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.48,0:27:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.35,0:27:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.35,0:27:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, nah. Nah, nah, nah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,洞幺 洞幺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.47,0:27:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-你能听到吗 幻影? -幻什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me, Mirage? Mir-what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.44,0:27:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.67,0:27:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.91,0:27:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mirage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.52,0:27:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.82,0:27:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.02,0:27:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.50,0:27:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 哟 慢点! 慢点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, yo, yo, slow down! Slow down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.18,0:28:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好极了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That felt good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.82,0:28:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-给力啊 你懂的 -该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some oil pumping, you know? Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.59,0:28:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我闭关很久了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been cooped up forever, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.36,0:28:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我都忘记有多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you how old it gets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.39,0:28:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影 藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mirage, stay hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影 别让人注意到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage, don't draw any attention to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.33,0:28:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影 《长大》只是一部电影 你永远不会成为那个男孩 ”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage, Big is just a movie. You'll never be a real boy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.54,0:28:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但那很有趣 伙计 你真有趣 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was fun, man. You're fun, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.34,0:28:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  对了 对你来说信息量太大了吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. This is probably a lot for you, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.81,0:28:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-后退! -嘿 怎么啦?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up! Hey, whoa, whoa, whoa. What's with the aggression?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为飙完车 我们就是兄弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought after the car chase, we were boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.19,0:28:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-你打算打我? -也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna hit me? Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.45,0:28:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.83,0:28:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Tough guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.96,0:28:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这样 我非常喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that. I like it a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.83,0:28:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么鬼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.43,0:29:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是被附身的车什么的么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of possessed car or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那是骗人的啦 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. That's not real, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.07,0:29:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我是外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.14,0:29:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就像……就像E.T.吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like... Like E.T.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.17,0:29:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,E.T? 待车篮子里那个丑八怪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}E.T.? The little ugly guy in the basket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我这张帅气的脸庞! 我的名字叫幻影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this face! The name's Mirage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.55,0:29:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 来一下 来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Give me a little, give me a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.55,0:29:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,来一下啊 轻轻敲一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a little. Give a little tap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.25,0:29:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻敲我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a little tap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.52,0:29:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 现在我们是朋友了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Now we're friends!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.52,0:29:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦 太棒了 -他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. The gang's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.53,0:29:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还有更多像你一样的? 一样的? 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more like you? Like me? Nah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静 他们才不会把你吓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But be cool so they don't crush you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.16,0:29:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啥？ 如果我是你 我会把管子放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Yeah, I'd put that pipe down if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.33,0:30:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 谁来了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, who have we got here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.27,0:30:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影 你做了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage, what have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.27,0:30:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你把人类带到这里了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought a human here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.34,0:30:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱!  嘿! 看起来不错啊 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimus! Hey! Looking good, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.88,0:30:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 那些是新的轮辋吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Are those new rims?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.55,0:30:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,让你藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were told to stay hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.65,0:30:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对的 对的 就是那么巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right. Crazy coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.88,0:30:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你在像擎天柱一样说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you called, all Optimus-like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.15,0:30:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,“汽车人 出发!”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Autobots, roll out!"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.12,0:30:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,…这家伙已经在车里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...this guy was already in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.02,0:30:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但他真的很酷 很酷 酷么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's cool, so it's cool. Cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.33,0:30:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁 人类?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.33,0:30:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我谁都不是 我什么都没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nobody. I ain't even seen nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.37,0:30:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在什么都没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even seeing anything right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.27,0:30:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arcee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,二等兵诺亚·迪亚兹 美国陆军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private Noah Diaz, US Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.64,0:30:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,多次被嘉奖 一个懂电子的老法师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Multiple commendations. A wizard with electronics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.65,0:30:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他是一名士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. He's a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.51,0:30:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他看起来不像个士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not look like a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.95,0:30:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你看起来也挺大老粗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you looking pretty rough yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.22,0:31:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.82,0:31:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我晚一点再处理你的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will deal with your mistake later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.29,0:31:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们感觉到的能量波动在4000千赫兹范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the energy surge we felt was in the 4,000 yottahertz range,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.83,0:31:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是人类无法察觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is undetectable to humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.80,0:31:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我从能量回声中重建了信号源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've reconstructed the source from the energy echoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.01,0:31:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我简直不敢相信 它存在 它就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe it. It exists and it is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.67,0:31:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底在看什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.68,0:31:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,曲速钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Transwarp Key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.18,0:31:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,它被认为在几千年前就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was thought to be lost thousands of years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.22,0:31:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经被用来打开时空传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was once used to open space-time portals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.65,0:31:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,到宇宙中能量块蕴含丰富的行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Energon-rich planets throughout the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.26,0:31:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说能量块丰富的行星 比如……\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Energon-rich planets like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.73,0:31:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,塞伯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cybertron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.99,0:31:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,地球上滞留了七年之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After seven long years stranded on Earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.96,0:31:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于找到回家的路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've finally found a way home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.23,0:31:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等我抓到你 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till I catch you, Reek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.97,0:31:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那么这个曲... 曲速在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so where is this t-tran, t-trun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.37,0:31:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,曲速钥匙？ 谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transwarp Key? Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.70,0:31:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,它在埃利斯岛新建的博物馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the new museum on Ellis Island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.57,0:31:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把博物馆炸了 然后拿走它!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's blow it up and get the hell out of Dodge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.71,0:31:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们不能就这么冲进去把它拿走 大黄蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't just go in blasting and steal it, Bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.85,0:31:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,人类会追杀我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans will hunt us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.61,0:32:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要的是悄无声息地进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we need is a quiet way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.62,0:32:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 让他去怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, how about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.03,0:32:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 怎么啦？ 拜托 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What? Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.23,0:32:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以从其中一扇小门溜进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could slip in right through one of them little doors,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.90,0:32:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起钥匙 留张漂亮的借条 然后安全离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}grab the key, leave a nice IOU and peace out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.60,0:32:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他是完美选择 怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's perfect. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.30,0:32:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这是个坏主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.67,0:32:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意老大的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with Big Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 这是真的 各位 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's been real, y'all. But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.08,0:32:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,呃  暂停 幻影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, time-out. Mirage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.84,0:32:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 放松 让我跟我的朋友说几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know. Just relax. Let me just talk to my guy real quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.68,0:32:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,别把我丢给这些混蛋 兄弟 我们是一个伟大的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, don't leave me with these tight-asses, bro. We make a great team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.52,0:32:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a waste of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.29,0:32:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不会为了太空机器人去闯博物馆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not breaking into a museum for some space robots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.22,0:32:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那友谊呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about for friendship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.59,0:32:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,钱呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}what about for cash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.93,0:32:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮我们拿到钥匙 我们就能拿了这块石头离开地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help us get this key, so we can get off this rock--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.90,0:32:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 爱你的邻居和身边的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense. Love the neighborhood and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.37,0:32:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我可以让你把我卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I let you sell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.67,0:32:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,兰博基尼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lambo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.91,0:33:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉利?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ferrari?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.51,0:33:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,印地赛车?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.91,0:33:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你拿钱 我走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you get paid and then I'll split.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.82,0:33:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我要做的就是进去拿钥匙出来是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all I gotta do is walk in and out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.92,0:33:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们会处理剩下的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do. We'll take care of the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.45,0:33:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,穿越火花 怀揣希望而逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross my spark and hope to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.09,0:33:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我大声说出来的时候觉得很老套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! That was corny when I said it out loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.29,0:33:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那大个子怎么说? 擎天或者别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the big man? Optimal, or whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.63,0:33:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me worry about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.03,0:33:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.84,0:33:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 他加入了 开心 耶!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Got him! He's in, baby! Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.13,0:33:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都是能变形汽车的机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all are robots that transform into cars,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都来自遥远的太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though you're from way out in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.50,0:34:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在有把钥匙可以打开通往你们家乡之门?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now there's this key that opens a portal back to your home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.31,0:34:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道这些是因为有个灯塔有射线射向天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you know this because there's a beacon light in the sky{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.64,0:34:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,而我因为是人类所以看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can't see because I'm human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.38,0:34:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-你说得好像很奇怪似的 -这超怪的好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like it's weird. It's super weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.05,0:34:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道最奇怪的是什么吗? 马克·沃尔伯格要离开时髦乐队了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's weird? Marky Mark is leaving the Funky Bunch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-我听说他现在只想追求演艺事业 这太疯狂了! -怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard he's just gonna pursue acting now. - That's crazy! What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.62,0:34:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样……多么美好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that... What a world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.55,0:34:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.86,0:34:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想赚钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to collect this money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.62,0:34:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在你那愤怒的老板发飙之前把他送离地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get your angry-ass boss off of Earth before he blows a gasket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别往心里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take it personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.43,0:34:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是想家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just misses home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.10,0:34:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他一直为我们被困在这里而自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think he blames himself for us getting stuck here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.50,0:34:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,地球本该是一个中转站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth was supposed to be a pit stop, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.67,0:34:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一个让我们重新集结然后一起回家参战的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}a place for us to regroup and rejoin the war back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.57,0:34:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱觉得我们被困在这里都是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime feels like it's his fault we've been stranded here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.24,0:34:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就像他要一个人搞定一切一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like he has to fix it all on his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.75,0:34:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 全体注意 前面有保安了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, team, heads up. There's security up ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.75,0:34:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不错!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.92,0:34:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这会很有趣的 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be fun, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.32,0:34:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 兄弟 你需要改变一下外形\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No, bro. You need to switch it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.45,0:34:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你得变成直升机或者快艇什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to turn into a helicopter or a speedboat or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.89,0:34:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我有比这更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something way better than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.84,0:35:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.64,0:35:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not like this plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.58,0:35:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影可不是一个喜欢安分的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Mirage isn't really known for being quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.85,0:35:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,至少幻影是我们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least Mirage is one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.88,0:35:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不应该依赖人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should not be relying on a human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.45,0:35:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.72,0:35:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道有一个对你很好的人类 大黄蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know one was good to you, Bee,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.92,0:35:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不是我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is not our world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.86,0:35:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,人类总是会保护属于他们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans will always protect what is theirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.83,0:35:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能相信自己的同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can only trust our own kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.80,0:35:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是接受不了真相!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't handle the truth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.07,0:35:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不让你再去汽车影院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want you going to that drive-in theater anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.05,0:36:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,夜莺 搜索这个岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightbird, search the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.49,0:36:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,狩猎终于接近尾声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, the hunt draws to a close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.68,0:37:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.67,0:37:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,糖糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fudge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.24,0:37:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿 你没事吧? -后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you okay? Back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.58,0:37:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还好吗? -后退! 后退! 后退!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, are you okay? Back up! Back up! Back up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.61,0:37:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这里没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think anyone was in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.49,0:37:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.62,0:37:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.59,0:37:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.63,0:37:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the janitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.40,0:37:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,保安!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.33,0:37:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不! 你没必要这么做! 事情不是你看到的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! You don't have to do that! It's not what it looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来你是想偷博物馆的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like you're trying to steal museum property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.31,0:37:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 确实看起来有点像那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's a little what it looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.64,0:38:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.41,0:38:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿! 哟 哟! 反正这也不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! Hey, hey, yo, yo! It doesn't belong to you anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.71,0:38:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不! 停下来! 别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! Just stop! Just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.78,0:38:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿! 放松 放松 听我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! Relax, relax, and let me explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.45,0:38:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西属于……\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.72,0:38:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,…这些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to these...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.96,0:38:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这些来自太空的巨型机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}these giant robots from space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.37,0:38:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.40,0:38:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm gonna need that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.07,0:38:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.61,0:38:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.31,0:38:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 ! 这是怎么回事? 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! What's going on here? Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.94,0:38:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你这才出现!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, it's about time you showed up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.32,0:38:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.68,0:39:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-你说的是真的 -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were telling the truth. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.65,0:39:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但这几个不是我一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those ones aren't with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们 把钥匙找来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip the flesh from their bones and bring me the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.57,0:39:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.41,0:39:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 有人跟来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we got company!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.35,0:39:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人 保护好钥匙!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autobots, protect the key!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.46,0:39:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,接我这招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.87,0:40:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别跑那么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.38,0:40:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 他们现在飞起来了?  这些家伙到底是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're flying now? Who the hell are these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.79,0:40:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.09,0:40:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢看低等生物遇到高等种族\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoy that look of confusion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.00,0:40:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,表现出那种困惑不解的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}when an inferior being meets a higher power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.78,0:40:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那些到底是什么鬼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are those things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.84,0:40:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.28,0:40:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!  别跟着我!  我不是跟着你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Stop following me! I'm not following you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.22,0:40:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是从同一个方向在逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just escaping in the same direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.46,0:41:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 继续前进 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Were moving on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.01,0:41:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 要坚强 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Keeping strong ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.72,0:42:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不管别人怎么想 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Dont you let them Steer you wrong ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.31,0:42:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 跟着节拍 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It,s a groove thang ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.69,0:42:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 得到心中所想 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Gonna give you what you Want ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.94,0:42:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 只有.. ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just as long.. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.83,0:42:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.74,0:42:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.21,0:42:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.55,0:42:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.16,0:42:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.73,0:42:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.57,0:42:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,天灾 我找到钥匙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scourge, I have eyes on the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.77,0:43:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 我们快要压不住这些家伙了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime, I don't think we can hold these guys...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.58,0:43:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.35,0:43:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我的上帝! 放我下来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God! Put me down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.42,0:43:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 太吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, that was so scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.19,0:43:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 帅啊 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cool. You're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.76,0:43:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,去拿钥匙!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the key!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.23,0:43:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 快离开这里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.76,0:43:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我! 我讨厌蜘蛛!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me! I hate spiders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.07,0:43:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快! 别死 别死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go! Don't die, don't die, don't die, don't die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.11,0:43:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,走! 快离开这里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.25,0:43:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这么快就想走?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving so soon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.42,0:43:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哟! 当心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.16,0:43:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.80,0:43:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏玩够了 我自己去取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of these games. I'll get it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.97,0:44:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在我眼皮底下可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on my watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.70,0:44:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 别害怕 人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, don't be frightened, humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.94,0:44:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切很快就会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll all be over soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.14,0:44:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你自称擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you call yourself a Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.24,0:44:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,元始天尊会感到羞愧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primus would be ashamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.69,0:45:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了被小东西给挡住去路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of little things getting in my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.46,0:45:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.10,0:45:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 队长! 我的队长!\N{\fnArial\fs30}O Captain! My Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.54,0:45:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.66,0:45:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.56,0:45:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我要给我的勋章收藏增加一位领袖金刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now to add a Prime to my collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.61,0:45:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,巨无霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.45,0:45:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好 让我们好好打一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Maybe we'll get a real fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.52,0:45:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们已经得到了我们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We got what we came for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.79,0:46:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.73,0:46:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cannot be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.21,0:46:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在必须走了 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must go now. Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.81,0:46:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,都我的错 死的那个应该是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fault. It should've been me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.38,0:46:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for your loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.95,0:47:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 女士 你是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, lady, but who are you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.25,0:47:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫飞箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Airazor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.79,0:47:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是巨无霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Maximal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.52,0:47:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,一个来自过去和未来的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warrior from both your past and future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.46,0:47:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  对 那…那些 懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. That-- That tracks. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.66,0:47:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在母星毁灭之前逃离了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fled our home planet on the eve of its destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.70,0:47:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们躲避到了地球 寻求庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sought refuge and hid here on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.24,0:47:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这样 所以你们是巨无霸 你们都是汽车人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So you're a Maximal. Y'all are Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.74,0:47:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那之前袭击我们的是什么东西?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was those things that attacked us earlier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.88,0:47:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧兽 侍奉黑暗饥饿之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorcons. Servants of a dark, hungry god{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.78,0:47:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那个以吞噬行星为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}who feeds on entire worlds to sustain himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.12,0:47:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙大帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.02,0:47:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说这个宇宙大帝吃行星是为了生存?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying this thing Unicron eats planets to survive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.79,0:47:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他给予了他的犬马暗能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. And he imbues his servants, like Scourge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.09,0:47:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好比天灾 让他所向披靡\N{\fnArial\fs30}with dark energy, which makes him all but invincible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.50,0:47:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他对宇宙大帝感恩戴德\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is entirely beholden to Unicron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.60,0:47:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙大帝由此掌控了天灾的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through his power, he possesses Scourge's soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.14,0:47:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,醒来吧 我的黑暗主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awaken, my dark master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.96,0:48:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,平身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.33,0:48:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我饿得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hunger is killing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.30,0:48:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you found?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.83,0:48:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salvation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.77,0:48:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,银河系将再次成为您的盛宴 我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The galaxy will once again be yours to feast on, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.94,0:48:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该自己去取钥匙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've gotten the key myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.71,0:48:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我早知道不该依赖人类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've known better than to rely on humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.38,0:48:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下 怎么 你在怪我吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, hold up. What, you blaming me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.65,0:48:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,去之前你也没告诉我吸星老怪的事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you conveniently left out the part about a planet-eating monster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.62,0:48:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你 宇宙大帝现在能用钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you, Unicron will now use the key{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.96,0:48:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,毁灭宇宙中的每一个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}to consume every planet in the universe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.66,0:48:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,也包括我的母星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including my home world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.73,0:48:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有拿到钥匙 至少不是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have the key. At least not all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.46,0:48:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.14,0:49:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-这只是一半的钥匙 -饶命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is only half the key. Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.60,0:49:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,巨无霸……一定是他们把钥匙分成了两把\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Maximals... They must have split it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.94,0:49:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,借口!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.68,0:49:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,找到另一半钥匙 否则你就得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complete the key, or else you will wish you had died{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.65,0:49:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和这个星球上的其他人一样都去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the rest of your planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.88,0:49:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为了安全起见 我们把钥匙分成了两部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}We broke the key into two pieces for safekeeping,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.75,0:49:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,然后分裂并躲藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}then splintered and went into hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.56,0:49:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道另一半在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know where the other half is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.73,0:49:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,据我所知 我们最后的族人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all I know, I am the last of our kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.10,0:49:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,应该在秘鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.60,0:49:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.00,0:49:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是石头上的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the symbols on the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.04,0:49:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,它们只在世界上的另一个地方被记录下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were only ever recorded in one other place in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.87,0:49:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,库斯科的印加太阳神庙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Inca Temple of the Sun in Cusco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.61,0:49:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,它是西半球最古老的建筑之一 我...我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the oldest buildings in the western hemisphere. I'm-I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.35,0:49:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜这不可能是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that that can't be a coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.25,0:49:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能追踪到秘鲁的那些符号 那些怪物也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can track those symbols to Peru, so can the Terrorcons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.35,0:49:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶在他们之前到达那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get there before they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.02,0:49:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然后干掉天灾 拿到他的部分拼成完整的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then kill Scourge and take his piece to complete the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.26,0:49:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo. Hold up. Hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.76,0:50:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你想找到另一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to find this other key{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.86,0:50:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,把它送给那个刚揍了你们一顿的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deliver it to the guy that just kicked your asses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.93,0:50:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,曲速钥匙是我们回家的唯一途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Transwarp Key is our only way home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.17,0:50:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这家伙得到了那东西 地球就完了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this dude gets ahold of that thing, it's game over for Earth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.40,0:50:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的家人 每个人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our families, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.58,0:50:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.65,0:50:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.41,0:50:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但我不会把地球托付给一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but I'm not trusting my home to a guy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.39,0:50:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,连自己的都保护不了的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who couldn't even protect his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.35,0:50:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,地球是我的家 我也要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my planet. I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.22,0:50:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.66,0:50:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我?  你叫什么名字?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? What is your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.27,0:50:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.33,0:50:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.83,0:50:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你能带我们去神庙吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you lead us to this temple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.11,0:50:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,阻止世界末日的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chance to stop the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.54,0:50:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.38,0:50:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你将拯救两个世界的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be saving two worlds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.25,0:50:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.17,0:51:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是你吗 刺猬?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, is that you, Sonic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.47,0:51:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么起来了 小狐狸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing up, Tails?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.87,0:51:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.99,0:51:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,太烫了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}This too hot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.35,0:51:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你玩那个游戏玩得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You playing that game too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.92,0:51:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,休息一下 这样你的手就可以休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a rest, so your hand can take a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.29,0:51:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打败它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.36,0:51:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我赌你赢 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My money's on you, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.70,0:51:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't quit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.50,0:51:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 睡一会儿 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get some sleep, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.21,0:51:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, listen, um,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.18,0:51:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我得...我得出去一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta-- I gotta head out for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.64,0:51:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道什么时候能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know when I'm gonna be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.55,0:52:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.45,0:52:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.56,0:52:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什么……不 不 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the... No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.06,0:52:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 停下来! 关掉! 关掉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Stop, please! Turn off! Turn off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.26,0:52:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能 我告诉过你别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, won't you-- I told you to sit tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.83,0:52:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉它 我不能关掉它 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. I can't turn it off. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.67,0:52:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是机器人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a robot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.80,0:52:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 回去 回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Go-- Go back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.54,0:52:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 关掉它! 我觉得你弄坏的线路把我的灯也弄坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, shut it off! I think your bad hot-wiring messed up my lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.81,0:52:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿球棒 哟 冷静 给我球棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the bat. Yo, chill. Give me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.44,0:52:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-他是说“蝙蝠”吗? -你会弄醒妈妈的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he say "bat"? - You're gonna wake up Ma!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.62,0:52:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你是个机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're a robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.12,0:52:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.53,0:52:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 你刮花了我的油漆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! You scratched my paint!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.00,0:52:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.77,0:52:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 他们不是这样对待外星人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, they didn't treat E.T. like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.60,0:52:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识这个机器人? 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this thing? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.10,0:52:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是工作上的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just work friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.77,0:53:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,“工作上朋友”? 你可进入过我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Work friends"? You've been inside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.78,0:53:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我告诉你那件我必须去做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, that thing I told you I have to go do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.65,0:53:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了他和他的队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for him and his crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.05,0:53:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要阻止世界末日的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to stop the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.82,0:53:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,世界末日?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's ending?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.02,0:53:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 也许吧 60比40\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Maybe. Sixty-forty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.45,0:53:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我不会让这种事发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not gonna let that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.06,0:53:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但这就是我必须离开的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's why I have to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.50,0:53:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拿点我的装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get my things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.80,0:53:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好倔的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.50,0:53:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？不 等等 等等 你不能一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. Whoa, whoa. Hold up. Hold up. You're not coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.97,0:53:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么? 你需要有人保护你 -那里太危险了 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? You need someone to watch your back. - It's too dangerous, Kris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.81,0:53:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你留在这里照顾妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need you to stay here and take care of Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.81,0:53:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你可能再也不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you might not come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.46,0:53:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.86,0:53:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-我? -怎么啦?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - 'Sup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.60,0:54:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾我哥哥 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for my brother. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.40,0:54:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, little man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.44,0:54:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.21,0:54:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他受伤了 我会来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he gets hurt, I'm coming after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.58,0:54:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我会保护诺亚 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I got Noah's back. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.19,0:54:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,主队吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.29,0:54:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,主队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.30,0:54:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子有心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's got heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.36,0:54:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真有勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cojones muy grande.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.70,0:54:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.18,0:54:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,武当在楼里 宝贝!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wu-Tang is in the building, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.28,0:54:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to be incognito.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.45,0:54:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 擎天柱 微笑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, come on, Prime. Smile a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.32,0:54:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不会疼的 让我看看你的下牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't hurt. Let me see that underbite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.49,0:54:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们要坐什么喷气机去秘鲁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So what kind of jet we taking to Peru?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.79,0:54:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还是一架飞机?哪一个都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it a plane? Either one's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.46,0:54:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要头等舱 好吗? 因为我的腿很长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need first class, okay? 'Cause I got long-ass legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.43,0:55:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他是一架飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, he is a plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.20,0:55:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不  别啊……\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no. Don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.00,0:55:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我我们在飞……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me we're flying on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.87,0:55:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.55,0:55:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的小伙子!我是大飞机 天空之王!\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lads! I am Stratosphere, lord of the skies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.57,0:55:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我要去秘鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm walking to Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.21,0:55:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.48,0:55:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.65,0:55:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.25,0:55:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.05,0:55:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.52,0:56:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.99,0:56:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我紧张的时候就唱歌 那能让我平静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sing when I get nervous. It usually calms me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.46,0:56:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次坐飞机?\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time flying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.83,0:56:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 这是我第一次离开纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is my first time leaving New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.70,0:56:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊 哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.34,0:56:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,布朗克斯 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the Bronx, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.70,0:56:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克林 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooklyn, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.80,0:56:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在纽约东部\N{\fnArial\fs30}East New York all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.48,0:56:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我来自布什维克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Bushwick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.61,0:56:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.98,0:56:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我爸 我们以前常去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, me and my dad, we used to go to this--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.48,0:56:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克博克街和格林街的披萨店\N{\fnArial\fs30}this pizza spot down on Knickerbocker and Greene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.05,0:56:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼的披萨吗? 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony's Pizza? Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.19,0:56:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说你爸爸吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, tell me about him, your pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.73,0:56:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个什么样的人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What-- What was he like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.99,0:56:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他做了40年的出租车司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a-- He was a cabbie for 40 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.93,0:56:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你见过的最聪明的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smartest guy you ever met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.73,0:56:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他什么都可以跟你聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could talk to you about anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,历史 科学 板球\N{\fnArial\fs30}History, science, cricket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.74,0:56:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,板球?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cricket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.48,0:56:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他也没上过大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he ain't never even go to college either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.88,0:56:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他以前总是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to always say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.91,0:57:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,“如果你愿意去观察 愿意去倾听\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If you keep your eyes and your ears open,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.45,0:57:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,生活会告诉你一切你想知道的 ”\N{\fnArial\fs30}life will show you everything you need to know."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.29,0:57:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才答应了去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why you said yes to all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.56,0:57:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我想如果他在某处看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured if he is somewhere watching,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.16,0:57:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,然后看到他的女儿做出如此疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}then seeing his daughter do something crazy like this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.77,0:57:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定会让他感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}would definitely make him proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.54,0:57:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的认为钥匙会在秘鲁吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think this key thing's in Peru?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.41,0:57:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我....我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.75,0:57:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的证据都指向那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evidence lines up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.15,0:57:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是的话 而且我们拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it is, and we get our hands on it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.29,0:57:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就得毁了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we gotta destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.86,0:57:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.76,0:57:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这两个零件 他们无法把钥匙连在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't unite the key without both pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.06,0:57:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那把钥匙 就不会有宇宙大帝 地球也不会被吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No key, no Unicron, no Earth getting eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.27,0:57:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但那样他们就回不了家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but then they can't get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.84,0:57:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得为自己着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta think about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.34,0:58:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做的就是找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all you gotta do is find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.51,0:58:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll take care of the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.69,0:58:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得能量块能让他起死回生吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think an Energon infusion could bring him back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.92,0:58:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.99,0:58:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能把他带回塞伯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could get him back to Cybertron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.30,0:58:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该带我们离开家这么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should have taken us so far from home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.61,0:59:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 千斤顶得把动力转向装置修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Wheeljack needs to fix that power steering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.08,0:59:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.45,0:59:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我在享受一个在蝴蝶和毛毛虫之间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was taking in a harmonious moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.35,0:59:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,和谐而宁静的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}between a serene butterfly and an unruffled caterpillar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.19,0:59:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的宁静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such tranquility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.79,0:59:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 老人家 你从哪里来? 塞伯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo-ho-ho. Oye, papo, where you from? Cybertron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.43,0:59:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪学来的口音? 口音吗? 什么口音?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where'd you get that accent? Accent? What accent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.90,0:59:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么吗? 我只是觉得这很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm saying? I'm just saying it's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.20,0:59:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我正想说 “你 米拉 爸爸 ?”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to be like, "¿Yo, mira, papi, de dónde eres?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.80,0:59:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,佩罗 我不想假设你也说西班牙语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pero I didn't want to assume that you speak Spanish too,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.74,0:59:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这样……对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}because then... Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.11,0:59:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有点种族歧视啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little racist, hermano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.78,0:59:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是想 你知道…哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to be, you know... Yo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.04,0:59:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但无论如何……的使命 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But anyway... The mission. Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.25,0:59:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但他是个机器人 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's a robot, like, so,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.18,0:59:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么算是种族歧视?\N{\fnArial\fs30}how's that racist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.39,0:59:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you guys, check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.39,0:59:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我的坐标是一座老教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coordinates you gave me correspond to an old church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.73,0:59:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看一看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.06,1:00:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那是圣多明各 西班牙人把它建在一座古老的印加神庙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Santo Domingo. The Spanish built it on top of an old Inca temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.77,1:00:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,正确 我在院子里测到了一些残余能量读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correcto. I picked up some residual energy readings around the courtyard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.74,1:00:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我猜钥匙就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm guessing the key's somewhere close by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.44,1:00:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们可能会遇到一些麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we may have some trouble getting there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.88,1:00:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,印加太阳神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inti Raymi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.35,1:00:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个让整个城市暂停的节日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a festival that shuts down the whole city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.95,1:00:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是夜间任务了 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it's a night mission then. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.52,1:00:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,天灾可能已经在来的路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scourge could already be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.79,1:00:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须赶在他之前找回另一半钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must retrieve the other half before he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.36,1:00:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我和埃琳娜会去找?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Elena will do it. Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.73,1:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们连两个街区都走不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all would never make it two blocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.90,1:00:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,教堂周围都有安保人员 你不可能穿过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's human security all around the church. You'll never get through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.60,1:00:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就得从你的书里拿出一个剧本来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll have to take a play out of your book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.54,1:00:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在众目睽睽之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hide in plain sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.74,1:00:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,混入游行队伍中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll blend in with the parade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.21,1:00:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这主意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.18,1:00:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会留意那些怪物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will keep an eye out for the Terrorcons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.08,1:00:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一有麻烦的迹象 我们就进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}On first sign of trouble, we are going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.85,1:00:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 快想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Noah, think fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.42,1:01:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你需要帮助 就喊一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you need help, just holler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.24,1:01:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.71,1:01:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, coast is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.68,1:01:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 埃琳娜 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, Elena, it's go time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.22,1:01:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,融入他们 表现自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blend in. Act natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.02,1:02:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人肯定在用他们的新宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autobots must be using their new pets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.22,1:02:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,到寺庙去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to reach the temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.29,1:02:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.52,1:02:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在为我们做我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're doing our work for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.56,1:02:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,去取回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go fetch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.30,1:02:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙肯定在这里的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key's gotta be in here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.14,1:02:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.09,1:02:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那件石雕是17世纪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stonework is 17th century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.66,1:02:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we're looking for is something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.79,1:02:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可老得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}much, much older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.77,1:02:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?和飞箭的徽章一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? It's the same insignia on Airazor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.44,1:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是方向不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not lined up right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.05,1:03:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你看到了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.65,1:03:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这下面有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's something under here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.46,1:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.36,1:03:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.04,1:03:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.44,1:03:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为它会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it would've--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.26,1:03:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那是印第安纳琼斯式那种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some Indiana Jones-type shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.06,1:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.33,1:03:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.24,1:04:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,发现天灾了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of Scourge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.44,1:04:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 这里没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, all clear here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.91,1:04:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.34,1:04:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这里都是些游行聚会的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just groupies over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.18,1:04:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,继续观察 幻影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on task, Mirage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.48,1:04:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 你得学会放松 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime, you gotta learn how to relax, my man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.87,1:04:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我们肯定是五千年来第一批来到这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we must be the first people to walk here in half a millennium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.75,1:04:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 刺猬 你死了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Sonic. You dead yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.05,1:04:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.89,1:04:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你刚才叫我刺猬吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, did you just call me Sonic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.19,1:04:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我想那是座寺庙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's a temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.26,1:05:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在找什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.13,1:05:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看到神庙上的符号了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the symbols on that temple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.40,1:05:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,和院子里的一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They match the ones in the courtyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.30,1:05:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想应该在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.48,1:05:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们找到了来这里的目的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we found what we came here for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.39,1:05:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想知道那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wondered what it would feel like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.09,1:05:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,亲眼目睹文物被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be there when artifacts were actually found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.69,1:05:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 来吧 用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Now come on, push.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.24,1:05:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你在推吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you even pushing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.37,1:05:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我在推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm pushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.69,1:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 什么? 让我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what? Just-- Just let me think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.06,1:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 它在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no. Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.86,1:06:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候 就像 就像假底层之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes there's, like, a-- like a false bottom or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.57,1:06:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.97,1:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我有发现了 看到这些符号了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I found something. You see these symbols?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.90,1:06:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过这样的标记 我博物馆里的艾拉梭雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen markings like this-- the Airazor statue at my museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.37,1:06:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.48,1:06:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不在曲速钥匙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not on the Transwarp Key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.78,1:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.46,1:06:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.83,1:06:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们继续 给我一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep moving. Just give me a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.07,1:06:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.04,1:06:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.68,1:06:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影! 我们有麻烦了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage! We got trouble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.61,1:07:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有个怪物在下面! 你们在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of those things is down here! Where are you guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.78,1:07:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住! 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang tight! I'm on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.45,1:07:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人在移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Autobots are moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.92,1:07:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一定找到了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have found the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.84,1:07:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.57,1:07:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,飞箭 人类在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airazor, where are the humans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在地下 往丛林里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're underground, heading towards the jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.26,1:07:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 他们在跟踪我们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, man, they're tailing us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.24,1:08:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,做点什么! 你想让我怎么做?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something! What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.08,1:08:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直都带着枪吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a gun this whole time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.10,1:08:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 你在搞什么鬼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime, what the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.27,1:08:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拿回天灾的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to take back Scourge's key{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.34,1:08:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,然后取下他的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then take off his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.99,1:08:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们! 我需要一点帮助!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! I could use a little help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.96,1:08:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是有人请求支援吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did someone call for backup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.50,1:09:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,刹车 刹车 刹车! 怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brake, brake, brake! What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.24,1:09:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,刹车!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.65,1:09:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这是替大黄蜂的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for Bee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.63,1:09:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.40,1:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.72,1:09:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的火气 擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love your fire, Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.33,1:10:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但你会死的像尘埃\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're going to die on this speck of dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.20,1:10:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不出更好的地方来埋葬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can think of no better place to bury you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.93,1:10:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 天灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will end you, Scourge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.30,1:10:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.83,1:10:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.54,1:10:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.21,1:10:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到水的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.55,1:10:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.29,1:11:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.48,1:11:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.31,1:11:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要找钥匙?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why are you hunting for the key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.21,1:11:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 大金刚! 离我的朋友远点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Donkey Kong! Stay away from my friends!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.58,1:11:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影?  别担心 你兄弟会处理好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Mirage? Don't worry. Your boy's got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.15,1:11:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,陌生人危险! 陌生人危险!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stranger danger! Stranger danger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.62,1:11:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.13,1:11:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 这里 小猫猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Over here, kitty, kitty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.90,1:11:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.71,1:11:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再问第二次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't ask a second time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.48,1:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 你们都停下来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! All of you, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.65,1:12:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,飞箭 擎天圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airazor. Primal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.85,1:12:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你们都牺牲了 你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were lost. All of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.93,1:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的人呢……他们是否……\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others... Are they...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.13,1:12:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是唯一活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am all that is left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.20,1:12:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 这些是我巨无霸同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime, these are my fellow Maximals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.74,1:12:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,犀牛勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhinox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.07,1:12:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,黄豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.74,1:12:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 吓到你了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about scaring you, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.38,1:12:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕吗? 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scared? Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.41,1:12:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我才没害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.05,1:12:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是机油\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just engine oil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.52,1:12:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我们的领袖 擎天圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our leader, Optimus Primal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.99,1:12:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天圣吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimus Primal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.02,1:12:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,以你的名字命名 塞伯坦的传奇战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Named after you, the legendary warrior of Cybertron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.49,1:12:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.00,1:12:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,飞箭 很高兴见到你 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airazor, I'm happy to see you, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.13,1:12:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但把其他人带到这里并不是我们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}But bringing others here was not part of our plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.27,1:12:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你带来了坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you bring dark tidings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.91,1:12:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,天灾已经来到地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scourge has come to Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.14,1:13:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's found us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.01,1:13:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他有一半的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has half of the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.41,1:13:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须赶在他之前找到另外一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must find the second piece before he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.25,1:13:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但它不在洞里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't in the cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.18,1:13:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 但为了安全起见 我们很久以前就搬走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was. But we moved it long ago to keep it safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.42,1:13:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,它现在在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.93,1:13:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.40,1:13:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来不是很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't look so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.37,1:13:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,天灾袭击你的时候 他会留下印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Scourge touches you, he leaves a mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.64,1:13:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.49,1:13:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才你叫我刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, back there you called me Sonic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.49,1:13:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你弟弟得了病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Your little bro's got this thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.63,1:13:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在广播中使用真名 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}about using real names over the airwaves, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.46,1:13:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你跟克里斯谈过了? 啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you been talking to Kris? Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.30,1:13:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他给我这个 为了联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me this to keep tabs on you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.87,1:14:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,确保我遵守我的诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure I'm keeping my promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.47,1:14:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.94,1:14:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,下次 附上警告标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, include warning labels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.04,1:14:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, go ahead, keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.98,1:14:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我穿起来确实更好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it does look better on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.88,1:14:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别问我身体的哪个部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't ask what part of my body it came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.62,1:14:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.62,1:14:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们巨无霸是一个先进的种族\N{\fnArial\fs30}We Maximals are an advanced race{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.72,1:14:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,致力于宇宙中生命的扩张\N{\fnArial\fs30}dedicated to the expansion of life throughout the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.13,1:14:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们用超曲之钥寻找新的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use the Transwarp Key to visit young worlds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.40,1:14:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,纳斯卡线条 蒂卡尔神庙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nazca Lines, the Temple at Tikal--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.20,1:14:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是你们留下的 对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you guys, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.97,1:14:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.27,1:14:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能为人类的聪明才智而邀功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot claim credit for human ingenuity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.71,1:14:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但你有钥匙 为什么要留在这个世界上?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you had the key. Why stay on this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.31,1:14:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,当宇宙大帝毁灭了我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Unicron destroyed our world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.75,1:14:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发誓要不计代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}we took an oath dedicated to the preservation of life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.82,1:14:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,保护生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter the cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.85,1:14:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,而地球是一个安全的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Earth has been a safe refuge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.33,1:15:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我是阿玛鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Amaru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.59,1:15:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他和他的家人是一个部落最后的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and his family are the last descendants of a tribe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.70,1:15:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经守护了我们几百年\N{\fnArial\fs30}that has watched over us for hundreds of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.60,1:15:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们到达时 他们和我们分享了他们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we arrived, they shared their world with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.64,1:15:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起保护了他们的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}And together we protected its people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.21,1:15:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我们的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.75,1:15:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你和人类结盟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You allied with humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.59,1:16:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.32,1:16:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你把钥匙给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you give us this key,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.76,1:16:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,明天我会点燃灯塔 把天灾吸引来\N{\fnArial\fs30}tomorrow I will light the beacon and bring Scourge to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.90,1:16:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,巨无霸已经牺牲了自己的行星来保护宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Maximals have already sacrificed one home to protect the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.50,1:16:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再冒失去另一个星球的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't risk losing another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.04,1:16:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,作为领导者 我相信你能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a leader, I know you understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.66,1:16:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是我想象中的擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not the Optimus Prime I imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.44,1:16:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他失去的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he has lost so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.64,1:16:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果钥匙落入坏人之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many more will perish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.44,1:16:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那会有更多的人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the key falls into the wrong hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.58,1:16:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你还有机会拯救我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had another chance to save our home,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.41,1:17:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你会有不同的选择吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you act any differently?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.42,1:17:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 你来 我想给你看样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimus, come. I want to show you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.43,1:17:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友会在这里找到安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend will find peace here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.40,1:17:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这是能量块\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is raw Energon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.20,1:17:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这个山谷里盛产它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The valley is rich with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.24,1:17:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这能让大黄蜂复活吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could this revive Bee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.64,1:17:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 但在这种状态下 它是惰性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but in this state, it is inert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.21,1:17:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,需要很大的能量才能点燃它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would take a great power to ignite it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.75,1:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,比我们这里的任何能量都巨大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greater than anything we have here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.35,1:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你很惊讶我们把钥匙交给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that you are surprised we entrust the key to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.65,1:17:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.46,1:17:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他们在一起很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been amongst them a long time now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.33,1:17:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,它们比表面上看到的要复杂得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is more to them than meets the eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.76,1:17:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,它们值得保存\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are worth saving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.43,1:18:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不摧毁它呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we didn't destroy it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.17,1:18:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也许还有别的办法能保住我们俩的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's another way to-- to save both our homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.64,1:18:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 我这辈子犯了很多错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, I made a lot of mistakes in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.71,1:18:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.55,1:18:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fail at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.19,1:18:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让我的家人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let my family down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.39,1:18:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你就像他一样 你知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just like him. You know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.66,1:18:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.96,1:18:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.73,1:18:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.20,1:18:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他也感觉到了 感觉什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He feels it too. Feels what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.53,1:19:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,像一头负重的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a beast of burden{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.67,1:19:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只是想把整个世界的重担扛在肩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}just trying to carry the weight of the world on his shoulders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.98,1:19:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为他是在发号施令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's some-- some general barking orders,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.81,1:19:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但当我看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when I look at him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.88,1:19:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我只看到一个大哥哥想要保护他的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all I see is a big brother trying to protect his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.54,1:20:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.68,1:20:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,飞箭吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airazor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.82,1:20:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到天灾!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel Scourge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.42,1:20:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他是……在我心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's... ...in my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.40,1:20:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 埃琳娜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Elena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.87,1:20:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.64,1:20:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,飞箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airazor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.88,1:20:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.25,1:20:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 防守就位!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, defensive positions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.62,1:20:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 保护好钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, guard the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.12,1:21:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,带上埃琳娜 找个安全的地方躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Elena and find someplace safe to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.09,1:21:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须保护人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must protect the humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.66,1:21:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,想我了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.36,1:21:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 埃琳娜 快出去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, Elena, get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.28,1:21:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须摧毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.22,1:21:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.39,1:21:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.93,1:21:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.86,1:21:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想保护你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want to protect your people,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.73,1:21:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你毁了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you destroy that key,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.57,1:21:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将永远失去家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}our home will be lost forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.54,1:21:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not have to choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.55,1:22:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Noah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.90,1:22:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.94,1:22:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.00,1:22:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.20,1:22:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等  我不是已经杀了你吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Didn't I kill you already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.31,1:23:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.91,1:23:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是能把你剁成肉酱的巨无霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Maximal that's going to rip out your spark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.68,1:23:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.05,1:23:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.02,1:23:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,飞箭 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airazor, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.09,1:23:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我控制不住……\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hold it back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.23,1:23:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,…太长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.16,1:23:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,打吧 飞箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight it, Airazor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.43,1:23:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,记住我们的誓言 擎天圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember our oath, Primal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.47,1:23:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不计代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter the cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.04,1:23:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行了! 飞箭 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hold it back! Airazor, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.49,1:23:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天圣!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.26,1:23:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.47,1:23:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.93,1:24:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.79,1:24:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不计代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter the cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.74,1:24:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜! 埃琳娜 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena! Elena, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.74,1:24:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.78,1:24:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,天灾拿到钥匙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scourge has the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.99,1:25:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,觉醒吧 全能的宇宙大帝 你的时代来临了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awaken, almighty Unicron. Your time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.76,1:26:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry, Noah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.73,1:26:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在为自己着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were looking out for your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.63,1:26:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不能为此生你的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even be angry at you for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.50,1:26:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的母星 我们相信与黑暗的战斗将会继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my home world, we believe that the battle with darkness will continue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.27,1:26:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,直到合而为一\N{\fnArial\fs30}till all are one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.81,1:26:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘记了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost sight of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.88,1:27:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你为你的而战 正如我为我的而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fought for yours as I fought for mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.95,1:27:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本该一起对抗黑暗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we should have been fighting the darkness together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.06,1:27:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没打完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I ain't done fighting yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.13,1:27:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 大家集合!\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody, squad up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.43,1:27:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把它拿进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.97,1:27:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有办法阻止这家伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a way to stop this dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.80,1:27:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太迟了 超曲速已经启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late. The Transwarp has already been activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.11,1:27:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它比超新星拥有更多的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has more energy than a supernova.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.91,1:27:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,任何干扰都会像炸弹一样引爆它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any interruption will ignite it like a bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.98,1:27:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一能阻止这一切的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to stop this process{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.68,1:27:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是很久以前安装的安全密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}is an access code installed long ago as a safeguard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.19,1:27:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那密码是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what's the code then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.79,1:27:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,密码和钥匙一起被拆开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The code was split along with the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.39,1:27:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可悲的是 代码的后半部分随着飞箭一起消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, the second half of that code died with Airazor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.76,1:27:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等 等等 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait, wait. I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.20,1:27:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把她那一半钥匙藏起来的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one hiding her half of the key--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.97,1:27:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,上面有标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}that had markings in it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.60,1:27:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我在你藏枪的山洞里找到的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like the ones I found in the cave where you hid yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.17,1:27:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,它们必须一起完成访问代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together, they must complete the access code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.47,1:28:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们现在有机会了 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got a chance now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.44,1:28:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,机会渺茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A slim chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.88,1:28:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们所需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all we need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.85,1:28:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能给我们指路的话 擎天圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you will show us the way, Primal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.32,1:28:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们需要迅速行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We need to move quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.12,1:28:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在传送门打开之前我们还有一小段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a small window before the portal opens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.32,1:28:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大到足以让宇宙大帝进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}large enough for Unicron to enter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.19,1:28:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这座桥由一系列通道环绕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bridge is girded by a series of tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.43,1:28:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它们对于巨无霸来说太小了 但是……\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are too small for Maximals, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.93,1:28:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但对人类来说可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not for humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.60,1:28:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果诺亚和埃琳娜到达中央天线\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Noah and Elena reach the central antenna,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.40,1:28:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以用密码关闭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can use the code to shut it down,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.01,1:28:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,移除跨曲钥匙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}remove the Transwarp Key...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.54,1:28:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,…在宇宙大帝进入大气层之前关闭传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and close the portal before Unicron enters our atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.55,1:28:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但天灾会看到我们的一举一动\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Scourge will be watching our every move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.71,1:28:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他会不择手段阻止我们拿到钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll do anything to stop us from getting the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.32,1:28:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就和他决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we bring the fight to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.69,1:28:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人和巨无霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autobots and Maximals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.96,1:28:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一起给桥充电吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}will charge the bridge together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.29,1:28:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,引诱天灾来到战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lure Scourge onto the battlefield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.99,1:28:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我和埃琳娜从后门溜进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}While me and Elena sneak in through the back way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.00,1:28:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来我们都要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like we're all going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.94,1:29:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们要死 那我们就死在战斗中\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we are to die, then we will die fighting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.71,1:29:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,万众一心\N{\fnArial\fs30}all as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.85,1:29:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界是你的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world is yours, master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.56,1:29:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,天灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scourge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.53,1:29:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.37,1:29:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.27,1:29:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,保护好钥匙 别让他们接近桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect the key. Don't let them get to the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.97,1:30:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,巨无霸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximals!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.43,1:30:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autobots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.10,1:30:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,出发!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.85,1:30:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,犀牛勇士 黄豹 变形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhinox, Cheetor, maximize!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.47,1:30:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,至少步兵们上钩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least the foot soldiers took the bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.44,1:30:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但是天灾没有 他还在守着钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Scourge didn't. He's guarding the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.68,1:30:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这将引导到曲速控制面板的底部\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. This should lead to the bottom of the Transwarp control panel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.82,1:30:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上钥匙 赶紧离开那里 你要怎么做?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the key, get the hell out of there. What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.32,1:30:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我去分散天灾的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go distract Scourge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.42,1:31:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不能单独对付天灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't take on Scourge alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.22,1:31:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,放松 我是幻影 记得吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. I'm Mirage, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.23,1:31:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 三!\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.63,1:31:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,它在那儿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoomp! There it is! Pow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.94,1:31:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得快点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.08,1:31:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,注意隐蔽!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.25,1:31:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来给我一场真正的战斗!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone give me a real fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.15,1:32:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要找人战斗? 我来陪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fight you want? You got one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.23,1:32:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.91,1:32:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.71,1:32:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别管我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.34,1:32:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 去拿钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, get to the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.01,1:32:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.75,1:32:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.05,1:32:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 走吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.19,1:32:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢 但徒劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave, but futile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.90,1:32:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 别碰我兄弟!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Don't mess with my boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.59,1:33:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.19,1:33:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会记得这个可怜的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will remember this pathetic planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.80,1:33:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one will remember you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.01,1:33:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影 你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.47,1:33:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,遵守我的诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping my promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.74,1:33:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影 不! 快点 你得起来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage, no! Come on, you gotta get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.68,1:33:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Noah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.62,1:33:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,主场...主队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home-- Home team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.12,1:33:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,主队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.93,1:33:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.57,1:33:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.14,1:34:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.71,1:34:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了另一个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the other human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.15,1:34:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙大帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.95,1:34:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你战斗得很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fought bravely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.52,1:34:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个世界已经是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this world is already mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.16,1:35:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.71,1:35:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.73,1:35:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 指关节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Knuckles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.40,1:35:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你在吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.37,1:35:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Sonic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.34,1:35:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯!诺亚?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris! Noah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.14,1:35:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.81,1:35:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mirage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.31,1:35:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He-- He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.58,1:35:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,死了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.12,1:35:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.29,1:36:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Kris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.40,1:36:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna win this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.47,1:36:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不会输 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't lose, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.47,1:36:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that were true,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.01,1:36:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.41,1:36:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.25,1:36:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.99,1:36:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 伙计 我不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, I'm not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.35,1:36:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌生病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate being sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.59,1:36:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,每当我想要放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever I wanna give up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.02,1:36:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是在旁边告诉我要继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're always there telling me to keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.33,1:36:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now it's my turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.86,1:36:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,继续 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going, Noah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.30,1:36:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你是个无名小卒 但你是我认识的最强壮的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're a nobody, but you're the strongest guy I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.87,1:36:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们太可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are so cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.27,1:36:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mirage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.34,1:36:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你活了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.14,1:36:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 是的 但是…我需要你来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, but... I'm gonna need you to take the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.63,1:37:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.23,1:37:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.14,1:37:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约 布鲁克林威尔逊大道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah Diaz from Wilson Avenue,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.41,1:37:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,公寓2-C的诺亚·迪亚兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apartment 2-C, Brooklyn, New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.28,1:37:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,电波里不要说真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}No names over the airwaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.12,1:37:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.52,1:37:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.79,1:37:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,天灾!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Scourge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.36,1:37:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得我吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.72,1:38:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得你一个人能搞定我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can take me on alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.02,1:38:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.01,1:39:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不会离开布鲁克林了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never leaving Brooklyn again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.59,1:39:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 能量块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Energon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.22,1:39:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 !\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.29,1:39:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.21,1:40:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的受够你们人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting really tired of you humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.70,1:40:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.46,1:40:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.37,1:40:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.17,1:40:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.00,1:40:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.77,1:40:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.34,1:40:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.71,1:40:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.98,1:40:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.28,1:40:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.75,1:40:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你又来了 你本该死了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You again. You should've stayed dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.46,1:41:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.69,1:41:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.09,1:41:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.43,1:41:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.97,1:41:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.44,1:41:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.60,1:41:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.44,1:41:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来揍你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come here to kick ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.28,1:41:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to have you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.58,1:41:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都守住桥!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone guard the bridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.58,1:41:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 关掉它!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, shut it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.66,1:41:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得给她点掩护!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta give her some cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.56,1:41:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会扫清道路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll clear the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.97,1:41:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talkin' about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.80,1:41:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,输入访问码 这能有多难?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch in an access code... How hard could that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.87,1:41:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you've gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.65,1:42:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你和我 天灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you and me, Scourge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.22,1:42:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们彻底做个了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's end this once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.33,1:42:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,主人 援军来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, the reinforcements!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.09,1:42:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.23,1:42:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.20,1:42:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.04,1:42:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.64,1:42:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.98,1:42:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.52,1:42:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我来搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.75,1:42:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧 小大黄蜂!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Bee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.82,1:42:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.35,1:42:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.72,1:42:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.19,1:42:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,向我的小朋友问好!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello to my little friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.56,1:42:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.48,1:43:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.65,1:43:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.62,1:43:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得快点了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.75,1:43:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.76,1:43:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧 你这个丑陋的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die, you ugly mother--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.19,1:43:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.33,1:43:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.13,1:43:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.69,1:43:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远不会看到宇宙大帝统治这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never see Unicron take this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.11,1:44:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.81,1:44:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克林 宝贝!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooklyn, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.44,1:44:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.98,1:44:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙大帝必胜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicron will prevail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.28,1:44:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.32,1:44:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.92,1:44:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候向你展示擎天柱的真正力量了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to show you the real power of the Prime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.60,1:44:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我一个朋友的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}This belongs to a friend of mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.71,1:44:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,面板\N{\fnArial\fs30}The panel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.62,1:44:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,被打坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.82,1:44:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法停下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.65,1:44:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人 巨无霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autobots, Maximals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.29,1:44:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退到安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}retreat to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.79,1:44:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会亲手毁掉钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will destroy the key myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.89,1:45:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 !不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prime! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.63,1:45:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定还有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.33,1:45:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bee, protect them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.84,1:45:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你的牺牲成为我们的誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sacrifice becomes our oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.48,1:45:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.39,1:45:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.69,1:45:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下他!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.37,1:45:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家跟我来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, on me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.21,1:45:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.98,1:45:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么我都能给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you everything you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.38,1:45:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.26,1:46:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.33,1:46:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到你了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.84,1:46:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我 诺亚 救你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go, Noah. Save yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.68,1:46:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,万众一心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till all are one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.10,1:47:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,万众一心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till all are one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.81,1:47:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,加大马力 擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch it, Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.68,1:48:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 宝贝!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.64,1:48:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙大帝……他死了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicron... Is he dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.11,1:48:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,被困住了 但没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped, but not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.28,1:48:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶永远不可能被完全征服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil can never be vanquished completely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.88,1:48:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他还可能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.45,1:48:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让他来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.32,1:48:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,联合起来 我们将摧毁他\N{\fnArial\fs30}United, we will destroy him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.56,1:48:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,彻彻底底\N{\fnArial\fs30}once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.26,1:48:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我是擎天柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Optimus Prime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.66,1:48:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}leader of the Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.30,1:49:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了曲速钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have lost the Transwarp Key{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.57,1:49:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有了它我们就能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with it our ability to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.84,1:49:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们收获了一个盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have gained an ally{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.24,1:49:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们与邪恶的战斗中\N{\fnArial\fs30}in our battle against the forces of evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.71,1:49:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,它的力量是如此强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forces too powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.02,1:49:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,单独个体无法击败它\N{\fnArial\fs30}for any of us to defeat on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.52,1:49:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要我们团结 就有机会战胜它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But together, we might just have a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.97,1:49:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我是诺亚·迪亚兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Noah Diaz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.00,1:49:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道关于我的什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is there to know about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.31,1:49:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在布鲁克林长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was raised out in Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.84,1:49:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个叫我刺猬的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a little bro who calls me Sonic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.11,1:49:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要拯救宇宙才能拯救我爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I gotta help save the universe in order to save the people I love,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.58,1:49:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我会去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, then that's what I'm gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.35,1:50:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.58,1:50:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来参加工作面试的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm here for the job interview?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.08,1:50:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚·迪亚兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah Diaz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.32,1:50:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉他们你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell 'em you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.89,1:50:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,本周日的《60分钟》\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Sunday on 60 Minutes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.72,1:50:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我坐下来和埃琳娜·华莱士谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sit down to talk with Elena Wallace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.49,1:50:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她最近发现了一座地下寺庙 里面有许多地下墓穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}She recently discovered an underground temple with a network of catacombs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.63,1:50:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,…可以追溯到公元前5000年\N{\fnArial\fs30}...dating back to 5000 BC.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.30,1:50:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过会有如此重大的发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never could've imagined making a discovery of this significance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.24,1:50:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这绝对是梦想成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's definitely a dream come true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.34,1:50:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克林 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooklyn, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.74,1:50:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're ready for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.05,1:50:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生 电梯在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir. Elevator in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.92,1:51:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说你的优势吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell me about your strengths?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.32,1:51:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我在电子方面的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}In addition to my experience with electronics,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.56,1:51:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一直在培养我的团队建设技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've also been really developing my team-building skills too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.06,1:51:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.60,1:51:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我跟你说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm gonna be honest with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.60,1:51:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的简历有点单薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Résumé's a little thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.17,1:51:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我最近刚找到一份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I just recently had a job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.47,1:51:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,国际性的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}working internationally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.78,1:51:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 在哪里……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, was that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.08,1:51:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我想你没写在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think it's on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.25,1:51:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是的……那是一份短期合同\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was... it was a short-term contract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.05,1:51:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, that's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.69,1:51:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不跟我说说呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell me about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.76,1:51:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在南美洲 所以我得努力学习我的西班牙语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in South America. So I got to work on my Spanish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.60,1:51:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈对此非常高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom was real happy about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.13,1:51:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么吗? 你知道妈妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm saying? You know moms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.57,1:51:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她真的 但我在外面的时候 说实话 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just really-- But while I was out there, honestly, man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.44,1:51:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就像工作 工作 工作 你知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was really just like work, work, work, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.24,1:51:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真遗憾 因为我听说秘鲁的食物非常好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. That's a shame, because I hear the food is really good in Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.71,1:51:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我没提秘鲁的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I didn't-- I didn't mention anything about Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.31,1:52:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是你去的地方 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's where you were, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.58,1:52:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我在库斯科?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was-- Down in Cusco?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.15,1:52:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,和你还有埃琳娜一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you and, uh, Elena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.86,1:52:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你的 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your, um,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.46,1:52:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 叫他们朋友?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, call 'em friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.00,1:52:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什么……\N{\fnArial\fs30}What...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.97,1:52:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.73,1:52:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很了解你 迪亚兹先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know a lot about you, Mr. Diaz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.34,1:52:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁? 中央情报局或者联邦调查局什么的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? The CIA or FBI or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.81,1:52:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一个秘密的政府组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are a secret government organization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.04,1:52:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,严格保密的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strictly off the books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.65,1:52:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们专门研究全球威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We specialize in global threats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.51,1:52:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,预防星球毁灭之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planetary loss prevention, that kind of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.52,1:52:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正处于一场持续的战争中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the middle of an ongoing war,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.69,1:52:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们希望你能加入我们的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'd love to have you join the fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.02,1:52:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your whole team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.66,1:52:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.09,1:52:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那些大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}the big guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.33,1:52:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.97,1:52:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个好答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.80,1:52:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.17,1:52:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, I want you to know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.74,1:52:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,代表国家的感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}in lieu of the thanks of a grateful nation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.07,1:53:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会照顾好你弟弟克里斯的健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will be taking care of your brother Kris's health care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.34,1:53:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的医疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.54,1:53:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始 他可以全天候接受就医\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, he will have 24/7 access{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.28,1:53:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,都是世界上顶尖的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the greatest doctors in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.25,1:53:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这些医生也不会询问病人的账户余额\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are doctors who don't ask their patients about account balances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.89,1:53:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.23,1:53:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你拯救了世界 孩子 这是我们最起码能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved the world, kid. It's the least we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.13,1:53:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.90,1:53:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会尽力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll work on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.27,1:53:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你弟弟会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's gonna be just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.54,1:53:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 克里斯说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris was right, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.06,1:53:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,电波里不要讲真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}No names over the airwaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.03,1:53:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真的需要你这样的人 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could really use someone like you, Noah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.73,1:53:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不考虑一下呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you think about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.38,1:54:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,“特种部队”?\N{\fnArial\fs30}"G.I. Joe"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.75,1:54:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.12,1:54:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝 给我看看 给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby, show me some. Show me some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.93,1:55:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,应该可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That oughta do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.30,1:55:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.93,1:55:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这完全是在浪费你的技能和我的专业知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a complete waste of your skills and my expertise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.77,1:55:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得结果还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it came out pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.81,1:55:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们可以称之为现代艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we could call it modern art{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.41,1:55:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,然后卖给苏荷区的几只猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sell it to some cats in SoHo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.61,1:55:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'm not selling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.01,1:55:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.81,1:55:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.15,1:55:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是关于5-0的事吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about the 5-0 thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.65,1:55:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我告诉过你 我没有抛弃你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I told you, I did not ditch you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.26,1:55:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在跑闪送 我以为你知道这出戏!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was running the give-and-go. I thought you knew the play!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.06,1:55:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 就算我甩了你 即使我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's say I did ditch you, even though I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.39,1:55:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看在你的份上 我看到你的脸了 就当我看到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your sake-- I see your face-- let's just say I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.96,1:55:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看在所有的血 汗和死去的总统份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think all the blood, sweat and dead presidents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.13,1:55:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你买这些汽车零件花了很多钱 我们扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put into getting these car parts for you make us even steven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.57,1:55:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.50,1:55:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这辆车很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}This car is special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.44,1:55:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这辆车是用汽车废件拼的吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}This car is a jigsaw puzzle made of garbage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.84,1:55:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我打赌这车根本就开不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I bet the joint don't even start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.98,1:55:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,打赌?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.39,1:55:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 幻影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Mirage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.70,1:56:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊! 你的兄弟来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Your boy is back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.17,1:56:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙说我根本不可能发动!\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dude said I wasn't even gonna start!{\r}
